or: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">これで<ruby>個別<rt>こべつ</rt></ruby><ruby>握手<rt>あくしゅ</rt></ruby><ruby>会<rt>かい</rt></ruby>のブログは<ruby>終<rt>お</rt></ruby>わりです。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">でもまだまだ<ruby>書<rt>か</rt></ruby>きたいことがあるのです🤩</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-10-04/26375_6.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_4222.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">あ、この<ruby>加工<rt>かこう</rt></ruby>に<ruby>深<rt>ふか</rt></ruby>い<ruby>意味<rt>いみ</rt></ruby>はありません。<ruby>笑<rt>えみ</rt></ruby></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>可愛<rt>かわい</rt></ruby>いですよね🍣</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">それでは！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">see you later ✩*.ﾟ#65</span></p><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;.SFUIText&quot;; font-size: 17pt;\"><br></span></div></div>\n                    ",
